These fixtures list questions, reference answers, evidence items and document hashes of
GraphRAG-Bench. They hold no corpus text. The harness fetches the text at run time.

Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/GraphRAG-Bench/GraphRAG-Bench, at the revision
pinned in benchmarks/datasets/graphrag_general.py. The benchmark code is under the MIT
license (https://github.com/GraphRAG-Bench/GraphRAG-Benchmark). The dataset card states
no license for the data, so the questions, answers and evidence keep the rights of their
authors. The corpus text has its own terms: see benchmarks/results/NOTICE.

Selection: lite.json holds 2 Medical questions on the first Medical extract. full.json
holds 130 Medical and 120 Novel questions, sampled with seed 42 in proportion to the
question types of each population, with ten fixed questions forced in.

Builder: benchmarks/fixtures/builders/graphrag_general.py. Run
"uv run python -m benchmarks.fixtures.builders.graphrag_general" to rebuild both files.
